# === Engine: Godot ===
.godot/
*.translation
# export_presets.cfg IS committed. Godot's stock ignore drops it because it can carry signing
# credentials; this one carries none, and it is the only record of how the shipped build is
# made -- including the include/exclude filters that decide whether the Axie mixer asset pack
# reaches the .pck at all. Losing it is how a web build ends up with no Axies in it.
!export_presets.cfg
# Uncomment if using Godot:
# *.import

